Meterless World Model engine

engine/ holds the Meterless World Model reference engine and conformance/ its official conformance suite,
both copied unchanged from github.com/Meterless/Meterless under the Apache License 2.0. The full license text
is in engine/LICENSE, and engine/ORIGIN.md names the source commit.

server.ts and package.json wrap the engine as a local HTTP service for this application.
